{"seq":1,"slug":"cross-system-e2e-flow","title":"下单-支付-物流-清关端到端流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/cross-border-integration-sandbox/e2e-integration/cross-system-e2e-flow","wordCount":2365,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"下单-支付-物流-清关端到端流\">下单-支付-物流-清关端到端流</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把前面三章的能力串起来，你会得到一条链：用户下单 → 创建支付 → 收到支付回调 → 创建运单 → 轨迹推进到出口 → 清关 → 末端派送 → 签收。这条链跨了四个系统、三种时间尺度、四套状态模型。端到端用例要做的就是<strong>把这条链表达成一组可断言、可重放、失败可定位的步骤</strong>。</p>\n<p>难点不在步骤多，而在<strong>跨系统的状态对应关系</strong>。同一笔交易在不同系统里有不同的标识与状态：订单系统里有 <code>orderId</code> 与 <code>orderStatus</code>，支付渠道有 <code>paymentIntentId</code> 与 <code>status</code>，承运商有 <code>trackingNumber</code> 与 <code>deliveryStatus</code>，海关有 <code>declarationId</code> 与 <code>clearanceStatus</code>。端到端用例必须维护这些标识之间的映射，并在每个断点检查映射没有被破坏——<strong>悬单（一笔交易在一个系统里是终态、在另一个系统里还挂着）正是映射断裂的表现</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;订单系统&lt;br/&gt;orderId / orderStatus&quot;] --&gt;|paymentRef| B[&quot;支付渠道&lt;br/&gt;paymentIntentId / status&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|trackingNumber| C[&quot;承运商&lt;br/&gt;deliveryStatus&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|declarationId| D[&quot;海关&lt;br/&gt;clearanceStatus&quot;]&#10;    B -.-&gt;|回调| A&#10;    C -.-&gt;|轨迹事件| A&#10;    D -.-&gt;|清关通知| A&#10;    A --&gt; E[对账与一致性校验]\">graph LR\n    A[\"订单系统&lt;br/&gt;orderId / orderStatus\"] --&gt;|paymentRef| B[\"支付渠道&lt;br/&gt;paymentIntentId / status\"]\n    A --&gt;|trackingNumber| C[\"承运商&lt;br/&gt;deliveryStatus\"]\n    A --&gt;|declarationId| D[\"海关&lt;br/&gt;clearanceStatus\"]\n    B -.-&gt;|回调| A\n    C -.-&gt;|轨迹事件| A\n    D -.-&gt;|清关通知| A\n    A --&gt; E[对账与一致性校验]</pre><h2 id=\"步骤模型与断点断言\">步骤模型与断点断言</h2><p>端到端用例的骨架是一个有序的步骤列表，每步包含一个动作与一组断言。动作是对被测系统的真实调用（下单、拉起支付），或者是对模拟器的调用（注入回调、推进轨迹）；断言既可以是同步的立即检查，也可以是带超时的等待检查。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"id: e2e-br-customs-tax&#10;title: 巴西订单全链路（含清关征税）&#10;steps:&#10;  - action: create_order&#10;    scenario: br-tax-collect&#10;    assert: { orderStatus: CREATED, orderIdMatches: &#39;^r-.*&#39; }&#10;  - action: initiate_payment&#10;    assert: { within: 10s, orderStatus: PAYMENT_PENDING }&#10;  - action: inject_payment_callback&#10;    args: { outcome: succeeded, delayMs: 3000 }&#10;    assert: { within: 30s, orderStatus: PAID, paymentRef: &#39;not_null&#39; }&#10;  - action: wait&#10;    assert: { within: 60s, trackingNumber: &#39;not_null&#39;, orderStatus: SHIPPED }&#10;  - action: advance_tracking&#10;    args: { script: br-standard-express, toNode: ARRIVED_DEST, speedFactor: 0.001 }&#10;    assert: { within: 60s, orderStatus: IN_CUSTOMS }&#10;  - action: advance_customs&#10;    args: { script: customs-tax-due, amount: { value: &#39;47.30&#39;, currency: &#39;BRL&#39; } }&#10;    assert: { within: 60s, orderStatus: TAX_PENDING, taxNoticeSent: true }&#10;  - action: pay_tax&#10;    assert: { within: 30s, orderStatus: CUSTOMS_RELEASED }&#10;  - action: advance_tracking&#10;    args: { toNode: DELIVERED }&#10;    assert: { within: 60s, orderStatus: DELIVERED, buyerNotified: [&#39;清关中&#39;, &#39;已签收&#39;] }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">e2e-br-customs-tax</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">巴西订单全链路（含清关征税）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">create_order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    scenario</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">br-tax-collect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">orderStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">orderIdMatches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^r-.*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">initiate_payment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">within</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">orderStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PAYMENT_PENDING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">inject_payment_callback</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">succeeded</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">delayMs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">within</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">orderStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PAID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">paymentRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'not_null'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"c